{"work":"tipitaka","version":"sc-pli","book":"kp","chapter":4,"title":"Kumārapañhā","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"Ekaṁ nāma kiṁ? Sabbe sattā āhāraṭṭhitikā."},
{"v":"2","t":"Dve nāma kiṁ? Nāmañca rūpañca."},
{"v":"3","t":"Tīṇi nāma kiṁ? Tisso vedanā."},
{"v":"4","t":"Cattāri nāma kiṁ? Cattāri ariyasaccāni."},
{"v":"5","t":"Pañca nāma kiṁ? Pañcupādānakkhandhā."},
{"v":"6","t":"Cha nāma kiṁ? Cha ajjhattikāni āyatanāni."},
{"v":"7","t":"Satta nāma kiṁ? Satta bojjhaṅgā."},
{"v":"8","t":"Aṭṭha nāma kiṁ? Ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo."},
{"v":"9","t":"Nava nāma kiṁ? Nava sattāvāsā."},
{"v":"10","t":"Dasa nāma kiṁ? Dasahaṅgehi samannāgato “arahā”ti vuccatīti."},
{"v":"11","t":"Kumārapañhā."}
]}
